#X text 20 10 YOU AS THE CRITIC: good! adds +1 \, bad adds -1 to the reward of the last move: Q(ls \, la) <- Q(ls \, la) + alpha * r. The update is linear in the reward \, so this is exactly as if the world had paid it for that move. PRACTICE plays phrases silently \, as fast as Pd can. FORGET empties the table. A new GOAL starts a new phrase but keeps the table: you hear the agent unlearn., f 150;
#X obj 20 90 r \$0-good;
#X obj 120 90 r \$0-bad;
#X msg 20 116 1;
#X msg 120 116 -1;
#X obj 20 150 t b f;
#X obj 80 180 expr q\$0[4 * ls_\$0 + la_\$0] = q\$0[4 * ls_\$0 + la_\$0] + al_\$0 * \$f1, f 36;
